"num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 24554, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16374, "last_played": 1532307543, "avatar": "79b1b40c4c0b63a0750b46a17d71f8042987d445"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's like killing people... but in a military sim way.\n\nI've been here since the beginning, supporting BI for so long, and they have completely failed me with Arma 3. Just some questions for you guys:\n\nWhy are the vehicle physics so awful? Why can't you move around inside large, open vehicles? Why are the movements and animations so awful? Why can a player press v and step through walls? Why can't you jump, and why does the step up function just move you straight through the object you want to step up onto? Why does a 1 meter fall kill people? How hard is it to fix the \"simulation\" aspects of your game? Why do you think I would pay for a few extra guns/skins/helicopters IF YOU HAVENT EVEN FIXED THE GAME BREAKING BUGS YET?? WHY DO MODDERS SPEND MORE TIME WORKING ON YOUR GAME THAN YOUR STUDIO???!?!", "timestamp_created": 1364034276, "timestamp_updated": 1432482132, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}